UnitCLFactory::SetVoter
├── when caller isn't owner
│   └── it reverts with NotOwner
└── when caller is owner
    ├── when voter is already set
    │   └── it reverts with VoterAlreadySet
    └── when voter isn't set
        ├── when new voter is address zero
        │   └── it reverts with VoterIsZero
        └── when new voter isn't address zero
            ├── it sets voter to new voter
            └── it emits VoterSet
